DPara algorithm attribution

Fuliang Liu, Xue Li, Kun Qian, Zhibin Wang, Wanchun Dou, Wenyuan Yu,
and Chen Tian. When Parallel Drafter Meets Parallel Speculative Decoding.
arXiv:2609.27396v1, 23 September 2026.
https://arxiv.org/html/2609.27396v1
Paper license: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

The DPara candidate is original mlx2 code implementing the described algorithm.
No upstream DPara source code or paper figures were copied. The implementation
reuses local DFlash projection and MLP classes covered by
provenance/muse-dflash2.json and provenance/muse-dflash2.NOTICE.
